{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06742","headline":"次汝中寄河南陈赞府 · 王昌龄","name":"次汝中寄河南陈赞府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝山方联延，伊水才明灭。\n遥见入楚云，又此空馆月。\n纷然驰梦想，不谓远离别。\n京邑多欢娱，衡湘蹔沿越。\n明湖春草遍，秋桂白花发。\n岂惟长思君，日夕在魏阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}